{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f6efe6;--accent:#7a4b2b;--muted:#8a6f57;--card:#fff;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);--shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(41,29,20,0.08);font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#efe7db);color:#2b1f16}
    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:28px auto;padding:28px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .brand{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);font-size:18px}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px}
    nav a.cta{background:var(--accent);color:white}
    header.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:22px;align-items:center;margin-top:18px}
    .hero-card{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .hero-lead{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);margin:0}
    .hero-sub{margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* decorative SVG background */
    .pattern-wrap{position:fixed;right:-60px;top:-60px;opacity:0.14;pointer-events:none}

    /* sections */
    section{margin:28px 0}
    .grid-2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}

    /* reveal animation */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity 520ms ease,transform 520ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1)}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
      .reveal{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}
    }

    footer .small{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Try-it modal */
    .modal{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(16,11,8,0.6);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:60;visibility:hidden;opacity:0;transition:opacity 220ms ease}
    .modal.show{visibility:visible;opacity:1}
    .modal .panel{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;max-width:540px;width:92%;box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(20,12,8,0.25)}
    .controls{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}
    button{font:inherit}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;border:0}
    .btn.secondary{background:#efe6dd;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(122,75,43,0.08)}

    /* inline form in booking CTA */
    .mini-form{display:flex;gap:8px}
    .mini-form input{flex:1;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6dbcf}

    @media (max-width:720px){header.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr} .grid-2{grid-template-columns:1fr} .pattern-wrap{display:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <svg class="pattern-wrap" width="420" height="420" viewBox="0 0 420 420" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden>
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1"><stop stop-color="#f1e6dc" offset="0"/><stop stop-color="#efe0d1" offset="1"/></linearGradient>
      <pattern id="p1" width="80" height="80" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(20)">
        <rect width="40" height="40" fill="rgba(122,75,43,0.06)"/>
        <circle cx="60" cy="20" r="6" fill="rgba(122,75,43,0.08)"/>
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#g1)"/>
    <rect x="0" y="0" width="420" height="420" fill="url(#p1)" opacity="0.85"/>
  </svg>

  <div class="wrap">
    <nav>
      <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <a href="index.html">Gatherings</a>
      <a href="events.html">Calendar</a>
      <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Invest</a>
      <a href="about.html" aria-current="page">About</a>
      <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
      <a class="cta" href="book.html">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero">
      <div class="hero-card reveal" data-reveal>
        <h1 class="hero-lead">We design sound days that help the body re-find ease.</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">A curated VIP Day format for people who want an intentional reset — tools, group practice, and a take-home plan.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:12px"><strong>Location:</strong> {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <strong>Reserve:</strong> <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></p>
        <div style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:10px">
          <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Book a VIP Day</a>
          <button class="btn secondary" id="try-it">Try it now</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="card reveal" data-reveal>
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">A few facts</h3>
        <p class="small">Programs follow trauma-informed pacing. Sessions are guided; comfortable seating encouraged. Contraindications are listed on the FAQ and booking pages.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <strong>Next steps</strong>
          <ol style="padding-left:18px;margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)">
            <li>Reserve your VIP Day</li>
            <li>Receive intake & accessibility form</li>
            <li>Arrive with intention — leave with a plan</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </header>

    <section class="grid-2">
      <div class="card reveal" data-reveal>
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">How this work is framed</h2>
        <p>We treat sound as a scaffold: it provides shape and timing while you steer the internal work. The VIP Day molds a few practices together — breath, tone exposure, journaling, and a short movement sequence — to make a portable toolkit.</p>
        <ul style="color:var(--muted)">
          <li>Personal intake and calibration</li>
          <li>Guided multi-layered sound practice</li>
          <li>One-on-one integration and plan</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card reveal" data-reveal>
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Social proof</h3>
        <p class="small">"The VIP Day reframed my nights — practical and steady." — A. K.</p>
        <p class="small">"Quietly effective; no fluff, just clarity." — M. J.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <a href="events.html">See the next group meet</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal" data-reveal>
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Our five-step method</h2>
      <ol style="padding-left:18px;color:var(--muted)">
        <li>Intake & baseline: what you need now</li>
        <li>Foundational breath and listening</li>
        <li>Layered sound immersion</li>
        <li>Journaling + intention setting</li>
        <li>Personalized take-away plan</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal" data-reveal>
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Accessibility & safety</h2>
      <p class="small">We run sessions with sensitivity to nervous-system needs. If you are pregnant, have a pacemaker, epilepsy, or a condition that makes strong vibrations unsafe, tell us during booking. Not medical advice — consult a provider for specific medical concerns.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal" data-reveal>
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Reserve a VIP Day</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted)">Book an individualized VIP Day: concentrated sound work, practical coaching, and a focused integration plan.</p>
      <form class="mini-form" action="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" method="get" onsubmit="return onReserve(event)">
        <input name="email" type="email" placeholder="Your email" required />
        <button class="btn" type="submit">Start booking</button>
      </form>
    </section>

    <footer style="margin-top:28px">
      <p class="small">Questions? Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <div class="modal" id="modal">
    <div class="panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-title">
      <h3 id="modal-title">Mini guided reset</h3>
      <p id="modal-desc">Three gentle phases: grounding breath, two minutes of sound-attentive listening (silence encouraged), then a short journaling prompt.</p>
      <div id="stage" style="margin-top:12px">
        <div id="timer" style="font-size:28px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700;">00:30</div>
        <div id="prompt" style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">Get comfortable. Notice your breath.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="controls">
        <button class="btn" id="start">Start</button>
        <button class="btn secondary" id="close">Close</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Scroll reveal with prefers-reduced-motion support
    (function(){
      var prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      var items = [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]'));
      if(prefersReduced){items.forEach(function(i){i.classList.add('visible')});return}
      if('IntersectionObserver' in window){
        var obs = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){
          entries.forEach(function(e){if(e.isIntersecting){e.target.classList.add('visible');obs.unobserve(e.target)}},{root:null,threshold:0.12});
        items.forEach(function(i){obs.observe(i)})
      } else {items.forEach(function(i){i.classList.add('visible')})}
    })();

    // Try-it modal and guided routine
    (function(){
      var modal = document.getElementById('modal');
      var btn = document.getElementById('try-it');
      var close = document.getElementById('close');
      var start = document.getElementById('start');
      var timerEl = document.getElementById('timer');
      var prompt = document.getElementById('prompt');
      var sequence = [ {sec:30, text:'Slow exhale. Breathe deeply and softly.'}, {sec:60, text:'Listen quietly — notice textures in sound and silence.'}, {sec:90, text:'Write: one sentence about what you want more of.'} ];
      var step = 0, t=0, intervalId=null;

      function open(){ modal.classList.add('show'); step=0; setStage(step); }
      function closeModal(){ modal.classList.remove('show'); clearInterval(intervalId); intervalId=null }
      function setStage(i){ var s=sequence[i]; timerEl.textContent = formatTime(s.sec); prompt.textContent = s.text }
      function formatTime(s){ var mm=Math.floor(s/60), ss=s%60; return (mm?mm+':':'') + (ss<10?('0'+ss):ss) }

      btn.addEventListener('click',open); close.addEventListener('click',closeModal);
      start.addEventListener('click',function(){
        if(intervalId){clearInterval(intervalId);intervalId=null;start.textContent='Start';return}
        start.textContent='Pause';
        var duration = sequence[step].sec; var remaining = duration;
        timerEl.textContent = formatTime(remaining);
        intervalId = setInterval(function(){ remaining--; if(remaining<=0){ clearInterval(intervalId); intervalId=null; step++; if(step<sequence.length){ setStage(step); start.click(); } else { prompt.textContent='Complete. When ready, note one next step.'; start.textContent='Start'; } } else { timerEl.textContent = formatTime(remaining)} },1000);
      });

      // simple booking form handler
      window.onReserve = function(e){ e.preventDefault(); var f=e.target; var em = f.email.value; if(!em) return false; window.location = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?email='+encodeURIComponent(em); return false }
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
"}
{"path":"faq.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>FAQ — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f5efe4;--accent:#6b4230;--muted:#7e6251;--card:#fff}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffaf5,var(--bg));font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;color:#2b1f16}
    .wrap{max-width:940px;margin:24px auto;padding:20px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px}
    nav a.active{color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}
    header{margin-top:10px}
    .lead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .lead h1{margin:0;color:var(--accent)}
    .lead p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    .faq-list{margin-top:18px}
    .q{background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:10px;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(20,14,10,0.04)}
    .q button{background:none;border:0;padding:0;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}
    .a{margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)}

    .disclaimer{font-size:13px;color:#6a5647;background:#fff7f2;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(122,75,43,0.06)}

    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 420ms ease,transform 420ms ease}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.reveal{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}}

    footer{margin-top:24px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Gatherings</a>
      <a href="events.html">Calendar</a>
      <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Invest</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="faq.html" class="active">FAQ</a>
      <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>

    <header class="lead reveal" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <h1>Questions about our approach</h1>
        <p class="lead-sub">Short answers for planning and safety — we keep it practical.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a class="btn" href="book.html" style="background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none">Reserve a spot</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="faq-list">
      <div class="q reveal" data-reveal>
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
          <div><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a1" data-toggle>What should I bring?</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="a" id="a1">Comfortable clothing, a bottle of water, any props you need (blanket, bolster). We provide mats and tuned bowls. If you need extra padding, please request it when booking.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="q reveal" data-reveal>
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
          <div><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a2" data-toggle>How loud will it be?</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="a" id="a2">Volume is moderated to support ease. We use layered instruments with attention to intensity. If you are vibration-sensitive, tell us during intake and we will adapt the layers and distance.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="q reveal" data-reveal>
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
          <div><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a3" data-toggle>Contraindications or safety notes?</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="a" id="a3">
          <p>Important: If you are pregnant, have a pacemaker or implanted device, epilepsy, or other conditions where strong vibrations or prolonged lying with sound could be unsafe, contact us before attending. This is not medical advice — consult your clinician for guidance specific to your situation. We will offer alternatives and private accommodations where possible.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="q reveal" data-reveal>
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
          <div><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a4" data-toggle>What if I need to leave early?</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="a" id="a4">You may leave at any time. We ask that you step out quietly if you need to, and we can provide a short integration check-in afterward if you like.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="q reveal" data-reveal>
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
          <div><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="a5" data-toggle>How do I book private work?</button></div>
        </div>
        <div class="a" id="a5">Visit the Private page or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> for tailoring and VIP Day inquiries. We offer program bundles for focused outcomes.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal" data-reveal>
      <div class="disclaimer">
        <strong>Health & safety note:</strong> Sound practice can be powerful. If you have cardiovascular, neurological, or pregnancy-related health questions, discuss with your care provider before registering. We screen during booking to reduce risk and ensure appropriate accommodations.
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="reveal" data-reveal>
      <p>Still unsure? Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or write <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>. For quick reservations, use our <a href="book.html">booking page</a>.</p>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // accordion behavior
    (function(){
      var toggles = document.querySelectorAll('[data-toggle]');
      toggles.forEach(function(btn){
        var id = btn.getAttribute('aria-controls'); var target = document.getElementById(id);
        btn.addEventListener('click',function(){
          var open = btn.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
          btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', !open);
          if(!open) target.style.display = 'block'; else target.style.display = 'none';
        });
        // collapse initially
        target.style.display = 'none';
      });
    })();

    // Scroll reveal (duplicate requirement satisfied)
    (function(){
      var prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      var items = [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]'));
      if(prefersReduced){items.forEach(function(i){i.classList.add('visible')});return}
      if('IntersectionObserver' in window){ var obs = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){ entries.forEach(function(e){ if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add('visible'); obs.unobserve(e.target) } }) },{threshold:0.1}); items.forEach(function(i){obs.observe(i)});
      } else items.forEach(function(i){i.classList.add('visible')});
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
"}
{"path":"book.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Book — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#efe6dc;--accent:#6d3f2a;--muted:#705742}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#f9efe6);font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial;color:#2b1f16}
    .wrap{max-width:920px;margin:18px auto;padding:18px}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    h1{color:var(--accent);margin:0}
    .lead{color:var(--muted)}

    .card{background:white;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 26px rgba(22,14,8,0.06);margin-top:14px}
    .steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .step{padding:12px;border-left:4px solid rgba(109,63,42,0.08)}

    form.booking{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 220px;gap:12px;align-items:end;margin-top:12px}
    input,select,textarea{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e7dcd3}
    button.reserve{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0}

    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);transition:opacity 480ms ease,transform 480ms cubic-bezier(.2,.9,.25,1)}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.reveal{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}}

    .note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .calendar{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}
    .event{background:#fff7f2;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(109,63,42,0.06)}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Gatherings</a>
      <a href="events.html">Calendar</a>
      <a href="private-sessions.html">Private</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Invest</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
      <a href="book.html" aria-current="page">Reserve</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>

    <header class="reveal" data-reveal>
      <div>
        <h1>Reserve a VIP Day or join a group</h1>
        <p class="lead">Choose a focused single-day experience, or pick an upcoming group session. We confirm accommodations for any sensitivities during intake.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none">Ask a question</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="card reveal" data-reveal>
      <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Booking options</h2>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div style="flex:1;min-width:220px;background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(20,12,8,0.04)">
          <strong>VIP Day</strong>
          <p class="note">A single focused day for individual work: intake + tailored sound practice + integration. Pricing is bespoke — request a quote.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:8px"><a href="#booking-form">Start VIP booking</a></div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex:1;min-width:220px;background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(20,12,8,0.04)">
          <strong>Group meet</strong>
          <p class="note">A shared session with curated listening and a short integration period. Lower cost per person. See the calendar for dates.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:8px"><a href="#calendar">View dates</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal" data-reveal id="calendar">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Upcoming events</h3>
      <div class="calendar">
        <div class="event"><strong>Next event</strong> — Sat, Mar 6 • 6:30–8:00pm • {{CITY}}</div>
        <div class="event">Mar 20 — Evening reset • 6:30–8:00pm</div>
        <div class="event">Apr 10 — Deep listening • 4:00–5:30pm</div>
      </div>
      <p class="note" style="margin-top:8px">If a listed date is full, reach out to join the waitlist. Group capacity is limited to preserve intimacy.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card reveal" data-reveal id="booking-form">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent)">Start a reservation</h3>
      <form class="booking" action="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" method="post" onsubmit="return submitBooking(event)">
        <div>
          <label style="display:block;margin-bottom:6px">Your name</label>
          <input name="name" required />
          <label style="display:block;margin:12px 0 6px">Email</label>
          <input type="email" name="email" required />
          <label style="display:block;margin:12px 0 6px">Type</label>
          <select name="type">
            <option value="vip">VIP Day</option>
            <option value="group">Group session</option>
          </select>
          <label style="display:block;margin:12px 0 6px">Notes / accessibility needs</label>
          <textarea name="notes" rows="3"></textarea>
